think Chose the honest gap the whole line family deferred: every line read (line_distance, line_segment_distance, line_span, line_project, line_band, line_summary, line_corridor_summary) approximates each object by its GROUP CENTER. line_pierce reads the object's ACTUAL BOX -- does the FINITE stroke cross each object's pixel box -- the read a stroke-selection surface wants.
think The crux is that a segment-versus-box crossing is EXACT with integers by the separating axis theorem in two dimensions: three axes -- the box's two face normals (segment bounding-box overlap) and the segment's perpendicular (four corner cross products (B-A)x(corner-A) sharing one strict sign = straddle). pierces = bbox-overlap AND straddle; line_pierces = straddle alone; pierce_only_infinite = straddle and not bbox-overlap, the box twin of line_project's foot_at_end.
think Modelled the object box in doubled corners (2*min .. 2*max), consistent with the family's min+max center convention, so all arithmetic stays in i64 with no +1 subtlety and no overflow (doubled coords <= 2*canvas extent, cross products well within i64).
obs Designed a 26x10 scene of six 2x2 singletons hand-computed: a horizontal stroke A->B along doubled-y 13 pierces A,P,B and misses H,D above it; E beyond the B end is line_pierced yet not pierced (the twin case); a diagonal stroke A->D proves bounding-box overlap alone is not enough -- P's box overlaps yet all four crosses share a sign so the straddle rejects it. Cross-checked line_distance==0 forces line_pierces, and line_span reads the anchors on_span.
obs GREEN on the first metal pass; tame_style_check clean (bans clean, ratchet counts unchanged); living_card_ascii GREEN after the REMEMBER edit. 224 image modules stand.
